OL,3,GNEWSAApproval given for 425 homes and
OL,4,A22 parking spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetailed plans for more than 400
OL,7,Fapartments have been approved despite
OL,8,Fconcerns residents will only be
OL,9,Fallocated 22 parking spaces.
OL,11,FCouncillors signed off detailed plans
OL,12,Ffor the development near Cambridge
OL,13,FNorth railway station on Wednesday.
OL,15,FOutline plans for the proposal were
OL,16,Fapproved by the government in 2024
OL,17,Fafter initially being rejected by the
OL,18,Flocal council.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
