OL,3,GNEWSAApproval given for 425 homes and
OL,4,A22 parking spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Thomas, development director at
OL,7,FBlocwork, one of the applicants, told
OL,8,Fcouncillors that residents would have
OL,9,Fan "exceptional opportunity" to travel
OL,10,Fby public transport, walking or
OL,11,Fcycling.
